Bits are used for representing everything
2 States -
    - On (1)
    - Off (0)

A bit is always one of these two

Nibble = 4 * bits
Byte = 8 * bits

int = 4 bytes = 16 bits
char = 1 byte = 4 bits

Hertz - A unit of speed/time
1 Hertz = 1 second
Modernly measured in GHz - Gigahertz
Omnibook has a base of 2 GHz

Cores - Microprocessors / mini brains
Omnibook has 6